## Why This Is Asked
Real-world systems must balance cost and performance in multi-tenant AI deployments. This question probes how to design routing, quota enforcement, caching, and versioned prompts with auditable tracing.

## Key Concepts
- Multi-tenant prompt routing and model selection
- Cost awareness and latency SLA compliance
- Per-tenant quotas and burst handling
- Prompt versioning stored in Blob with Cognitive Search
- RBAC with Azure AD and end-to-end tracing

